  "notes": "Modified cash basis school district. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p5-6); the 60,000 General-to-Activity transfer is eliminated in that column (Eliminations column), so transfers_in/out are null and receipts exclude it. Business-type = Nutrition Fund (p8); business_type measure cash (printed as net position, equal to cash 111,176). Beginning cash = total governmental fund balances 8/31/2024 (p6); ending cash = total governmental funds assets p4 (equals fund balance 7,951,340). Balance sheet from the Statement of Net Position Total column (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p9) lists functions only (no object breakdown) so detail_category is not itemized; categorical/federal programs mapped to instruction. General Fund transfer to other funds 60,000 is printed inside total disbursements 10,217,056, recorded as other financing -60,000 (includes flag on the total). The Depreciation Fund schedule has no printed receipts/disbursements totals. Other governmental funds combining schedule (p12) covers Activity, Employee Benefit and Bond funds; no budget columns there. Read pages 1-12 of 12",
